# The trial of pod-ws in podssh: podssh-ws keeps its WebSocket modules as
# thin glue over pod-ws (frame, handshake, session, close, error, server,
# plain and wake re-export it; client, url, h2_road and cleartext keep
# podssh's signatures and build a pod_ws::Way from a ProxyChoice: podssh's
# dial, its TLS context, its reader of HTTPS records and podssh/VERSION;
# h2_road keeps one Pool for the process; ForwardClose::remedy stays as
# the trait close::Remedy). The tests of the moved files leave podssh-ws.
# Each podcrates tag moves to the tag of the hand-off. The record with its
# citations, the repository checks; the builds of the default features and
# of the release's features; the checks of the features of the gate;
# clippy with the lints that the gate allows; the tests of podssh-ws and
# of each test of podssh-relay and podssh-cli that runs a WebSocket of the
# relay, a road of it or the server's side; rustfmt of the crates that the
# patch changes; each Rust toolchain of the workflows and build images
# against the rust-version of podcrates; the binary of the release's
# features for x86_64 musl, built with zig (a debug build: the release
# profile takes LTO), and podssh's static check of it.
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- remap Cargo.lock > /dev/null
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- check
python3 scripts/check-repo.py
cargo build -q
cargo check -q -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-core -p podssh-probe -p podssh-warp --features podssh-relay/blocking,podssh-relay/quick,podssh-relay/quic,podssh-relay/derp,podssh-relay/piping,podssh-relay/opentunnel,podssh-relay/code,podssh-relay/warp
cargo build -q -p podssh-cli --features iroh,warp
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo test -q -p podssh-ws --features plain-ws
cargo test -q -p podssh-relay --all-features --lib --test http_road --test relay_serve_cleartext --test relay_serve_contract --test relay_serve_h2 --test relay_serve_reverse --test relay_serve_routes --test reverse_carrier --test reverse_closes --test reverse_dialect --test reverse_framing --test blocking_plain --test limits
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --lib --test pipe_ws --test doctor_cleartext --test doctor_upgrade --test doctor_tls --test doctor_hop --test direct_proxy --test relay --test relay_serve --test ping --test proxy --test chisel --test upterm_hop
cargo fmt -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli --check
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-toolchains.py"
cargo zigbuild -q --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl -p podssh-cli --bin podssh --features "$(sed -n 's/^  RELEASE_FEATURES: //p' .github/workflows/release.yml)"
sh scripts/check-static.sh "${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/debug/podssh"
